<title>THAILAND: Ban Pu Coal pays 3.50 baht first half div.</title>
<headline>Ban Pu Coal pays 3.50 baht first half div.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dividend for first half ending June 30, 1996:</p>
<p>			  Six months</p>
<p>    Div (baht)	   3.50	   vs	N.A.</p>
<p>    Ex-dividend	  October 1, 1996</p>
<p>    Payment date	 November 15, 1996</p>
<p>Note: Company's full name is Ban Pu Coal Plc.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 252-9950</p>
</text>
